          "text": "Abantu abaasigaireho, abataraisirwe nfu ezi, bateegarukemu ebikorwa ebi baakozire n'emikono yabo, noobu kwakuba kuleka kuramya emizimu n'embandwa ebyaheesirwe omu zaabbu, omu feeza, omu mulinga rundi ebyabaizirwe omu mabaale n'omu miti, ebintu ebitasobora kurora rundi kuhurra rundi kurubata. ",
